EBT OF APPROXIMATELY $2.5 MILLION. AS OF MAY 31, 2023, 91.3% OF THE COMPANY'S DEBT IS NOW UNSECURED. THESE CHARGES WERE NOT INCLUDED."}{'symbol': 'CPB', 'date': '2023-05-31 08:30:00', 'title': 'CAMPBELL MANAGEMENT TO PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT AT EVERCORE ISI CONSUMER AND RETAIL CONFERENCE', 'text': 'CAMDEN, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CAMPBELL SOUP COMPANY (NYSE: CPB) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MARK CLOUSE, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, AND CARRIE ANDERSON, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A VIRTUAL FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE 3RD ANNUAL EVERCORE ISI CONSUMER AND RETAIL CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, JUNE 14, 2023 AT 4:15 P.M. EST. THE DISCUSSION WILL BE AVAILABLE VIA A LISTEN-ONLY LIVE WEBCAST ACCESSIBLE AT HTTPS://WSW.COM/WEBCAST/EVERCORE36/CPB/2144244. THE WEBC.'}{'symbol': 'CAH', 'date': '2023-05-31 09:00:00', 'title': 'CARDINAL HEALTH LAUNCHES MODERN COMMERCE SOLUTIONS FOR RETAIL INDEPENDENT PHARMACIES POWERED BY SQUARE', 'text': 'DUBLIN, OHIO AND SAN FRANCISCO , MAY 31, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CARDINAL HEALTH (NYSE: CAH) TODAY LAUNCHED MODERN PAYMENT SOLUTIONS, POWERED BY SQUARE, TO HELP INDEPENDENT PHARMACIES INCREASE OPERATIONAL EFFICIENCY, STAY CURRENT WITH CUSTOMER PAYMENT PREFERENCES, AND ACCESS INTEGRATED SOFTWARE TOOLS FOR THEIR BUSINESS. THE COLLABORATION WITH SQUARE ALLOWS CARDINAL HEALTH TO OFFER ITS INDEPENDENT PHARMACY CUSTOMERS ACCESS TO INNOVATIVE PRODUCTS THAT CAN SEAMLESSLY MANAGE BUSINESS OPERATIONS, INTEGRATE FLEXIBLE PAYMENT OPTIONS FOR IN-STORE, ONLINE AND DELIVERY PURCHASES, AND REDUCE PAYMENT PROCESSING COSTS.'}{'symbol': 'CBOE', 'date': '2023-05-31 16:05:00', 'title': 'FIRST TRUST ADVISORS L.P. ANNOUNCES DISTRIBUTION FOR FT CBOE VEST GOLD STRATEGY TARGET INCOME ETF®', 'text': 'WHEATON, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FIRST TRUST ADVISORS L.P. ("FTA") ANNOUNCES THE DECLARATION OF THE MONTHLY DISTRIBUTION FOR FT CBOE VEST GOLD STRATEGY TARGET INCOME ETF®, A SERIES OF FIRST TRUST EXCHANGE-TRADED FUND. THE FOLLOWING DATES 